<article class="ltx_document">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">LLM2Vec-Gen</span>: Generative Embeddings from Large Language Models</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
