<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Studied models.</h4>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="#A1.T5" title="In Studied models. ‣ Appendix A Implementation details ‣ LLM2Vec-Gen: Generative Embeddings from Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> includes a list of all student models and generation teachers, as well as embedding teacher models.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T5" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:80%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A1.T5.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:113%;">Table 5</span>: </span><span id="A1.T5.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:113%;">Hugging Face and OpenAI identifiers for the models studied in our work. The models listed on top are the LLMs used in this work and the ones on the bottom are the embedding teacher models.</span></figcaption>
